{"id":"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics.md","title":"Nondeterministic Multitape Turing Machine","display":"df-nondeterministic-turing-machine — Nondeterministic Multitape Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics","aliases":["73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics","73-df-nondeterministic-turing-machine"],"display":"df-nondeterministic-turing-machine — Nondeterministic Multitape Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics</span><span>73-df-nondeterministic-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nondeterministic-turing-machine — Nondeterministic Multitape Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (input alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (number of tapes)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\)</span> (finite powerset, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\mathsf L)=-1\">\\(d(\\mathsf L)=-1\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\mathsf R)=1\">\\(d(\\mathsf R)=1\\)</span> (head displacements, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在配置与运行子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\)</span>；分量是固定元组的唯一投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 的结构子句以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 为候选对象，不预先假设该结构谓词；其余子句才固定上面给出的有效机器。一步关系的两个参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NConf}_{N}\">\\(\\operatorname{NConf}_{N}\\)</span> 中的配置。所有带编号属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>，运行长度属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\exists\\Delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nN=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\Delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k)\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\exists\\Delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nN=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\Delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k)\n\\land q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}|=3\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\coloneqq\n\\{(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h):q\\in Q\\land\n\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\land\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T_j(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\coloneqq\n\\{(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h):q\\in Q\\land\n\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\land\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T_j(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\ \\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\\end{cases}\n\\quad T_{\\mathrm{blank}}(i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{blank},\\quad\nC_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(q_0,(T_w,T_{\\mathrm{blank}},\\ldots,T_{\\mathrm{blank}}),(0,\\ldots,0)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nT_w(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}w(i),&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|w|,\\\\ \\mathrm{blank},&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |w|\\le i,\\end{cases}\n\\quad T_{\\mathrm{blank}}(i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{blank},\\quad\nC_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(q_0,(T_w,T_{\\mathrm{blank}},\\ldots,T_{\\mathrm{blank}}),(0,\\ldots,0)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\leadsto_N(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h),(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\in\n\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\bigr)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\exists H\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k)\\;\n\\Bigl(((q,(T_j(h_j))_{j=1}^k),H)\\in\\Delta\\land(q&#39;,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\in H\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(T&#39;_j=T_j[h_j\\mapsto a_j]\\land h&#39;_j=h_j+d(D_j)))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\leadsto_N(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl((q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h),(q&#39;,\\mathbf T&#39;,\\mathbf h&#39;)\\in\n\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\bigr)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\exists H\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k)\\;\n\\Bigl(((q,(T_j(h_j))_{j=1}^k),H)\\in\\Delta\\land(q&#39;,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\in H\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(T&#39;_j=T_j[h_j\\mapsto a_j]\\land h&#39;_j=h_j+d(D_j)))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\ns:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\n\\land s(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(s(i)\\leadsto_N s(i+1))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\ns:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\n\\land s(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(s(i)\\leadsto_N s(i+1))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists s\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\land\ns(m)=(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\bigr),\\qquad\nL(N)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists s\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\land\ns(m)=(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\bigr),\\qquad\nL(N)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NConf}_N\">\\(\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\">\\(C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\\)</span> explicitly use the same finite-support multitape and input conventions as the deterministic model.</li>\n<li>Acceptance is existential over finite branches; rejection of a word is not inferred merely from one rejecting branch.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"