\in\\Delta\\land(q',\\mathbf a,\\mathbf D)\\in H\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(1\\leq j\\leq k\\to\n(T'_j=T_j[h_j\\mapsto a_j]\\land h'_j=h_j+d(D_j)))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\ns:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\n\\land s(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(s(i)\\leadsto_N s(i+1))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists s\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,s)\\land\ns(m)=(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\bigr),\\qquad\nL(N)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_N(w)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NConf}_N","display":false},{"tex":"C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)","display":false}],"bytes":4349,"backlinks":[{"id":"83a4535946978ce2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N$ with $\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)$ and $\\operatorname{Run}_N$ (nondeterministic TM and finite branches, see [[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]])"},{"id":"5487b1bca12f6c5f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Run}_N$ and $L(N)$ (nondeterministic runs and language, see [[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]])"},{"id":"4aa8d05c5e286fa1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma},\\operatorname{Run}_N$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]]；下式以单带实例 $k=1$ 嵌入该模型。"},{"id":"122708cc1f5bab8b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}$ and $L(N)$ (nondeterministic machines and accepted languages, see [[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]])"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","51696a3513b66fda"]}